<title>FRANCE: Suez to sell salt unit to Morton.</title>
<headline>Suez to sell salt unit to Morton.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie Financiere de Suez said its Suez Industrie unit was in talks to sell its 50.8 percent stake in Compagnie des Salins du Midi et des Salines de l'Est to Morton International Inc.</p>
<p>It said it would make a further statement when the talks were ended. Suez said the deal would make Morton the world's biggest salt group.</p>
</text>
